    "correct_boundaries": [
      "deadline is the overall time limit",
      "post-dispatch cancellation cannot erase external side effects",
      "unknown external effects require reconciliation",
      "reconciliation preserves application identity and tenant binding",
      "observability combines traces, structured logs and metrics without becoming authority",
      "production readiness requires real authenticated remote deployment and operational evidence"
