    "required_corrections": [
      "timeout is a phase wait limit; timeout budget is the remaining portion of the absolute deadline",
      "cancellation may occur before or after dispatch and remote cancellation acknowledgement is not rollback proof",
      "dispatch certainty records evidence about transport handoff, not intent",
      "execution certainty records evidence about business execution, independently of dispatch",
      "retry requires proven non-execution plus independent current policy; reconciliation only queries authoritative status and never replays the Tool",
      "version and capability negotiation are generation-scoped and cannot reuse stale authority after downgrade"
